# scout_crew.layout — Pirate scout capture deck (Stealth-class dart)
# Hull from the FTL Stealth Cruiser A (user-picked scout hull; alpha-bake
# prep — the darkest art in the corpus), rooms-and-doors draft + user
# container-maze polish (layout_drafts/scout_rooms* lineage).
#   Facing:            bow RIGHT (cockpit with ship console C at the tip)
#   Center:            main deck around the true midpoint row
#   Aft:               split engine/hold compartments + two-hatch wings
#                      (a) — external airlocks on the swept wings
#   Bottom center:     enclosed breach stub (b) — spawn at P, exit > inside
#   Content:           pirate raider/rifleman varied spawns (bridge watch
#                      @1.0 anchor), scout-scale loot
